					"id": "tCPXHw_RqZHZVEhzr",
					"name": "Need for Speed",
					"local_notes": "Lore: An Evil Sunz boy is happiest with an engine roaring under him.\n\nDesign: Perk (B9), +1 to Driving (Ork Vehicles).",
