					"name": "Finders Keepers",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Deathskull cannot walk past something shiny and unattended.\n\nDesign: Quirk (B9), roleplaying flag only.",
					"tags": [
						"Quirk",
						"Xenos",
						"Orks"
