			"name": "Culture: Freebooterz",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Freebooterz are Ork pirates and void-raiders, more mercenary and more willing to deal (on their own terms) than any Klan — the Orks other factions actually negotiate with, occasionally. They are a way of life rather than a Klan: Freebooterz come from every Klan, so this lens is a culture that can be combined with one Klan lens.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, culture flavour lens (not a Klan), combinable with a Klan lens.",
